ejpiú thún xhraún</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0145D"></COL> Colb.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thún pevtran.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejlqwún, kaiú ejn eJautwðé genovmenoû kaiú ejpignouúû
