 <COL N="0145C"></COL> eujchú touðton ejnivscuse</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0145" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0145D"></COL> Reg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejnivscuse kaiú qaumavsaû toú gegonoúû ejtrovmaxen
