Colb. habet quoque  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejtrovmaxen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qaumavsaû ejtrovmase</FOREIGN>  (sic)  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toú
genovmenon, kaiú uJpostrevyaû proúû toún patevra toú telesqeún
