uJpoú touð patroúû dielegcqevnteû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="5" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0158" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0158D"></COL> Forsan  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dielegcqevntwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thún te oijkivan thðû gunaikoúû
kaiú taú eiædh twðn Brwmavtwn, kaiú toú mevtron</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="6" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0158" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0158D"></COL> Reg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú toún mevtron twðn pothrivwn.</FOREIGN> —Mox legendum
