patevra Benevdikton nhðstiû eæcw sunhvqeian ajpevrcesqai»
 <COL N="0157D"></COL> Tauvthn thún ajpovkrisin dexavmenoû proúû ojlivgon hJsuvcasen×
oJdeuvsantoû deú ojlivgon thðû oJdouð diavsthma, pavlin oJ
