deú uJpakouðsai touvtou oujk hjnevsceto, ajllaú thún poreivan
nhðstiû dihvnuse. Pavlin ouøn diavsthma pleiðston oJdeuvsanteû,
ejk mhvkouû deú touð monasthrivou oænteû, hølqon ejpiv tina tovpon
terpnoún, ejn wßé phghú diaugestavtou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="8" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0158" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0158D"></COL> Reg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dieidestavtou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uådatoû uJphðrce, kaiú
libavdion eujanqevû. Tovte oJ sunodoipovroû touðton auøqiû protrepovmenoû
 <COL N="0159A"></COL> eælegen× «1Idouú uådwr, ijdouú libavdion, ijdouv ejpithvdeioû
tovpoû, ejn wßé dunhsovmeqa trofhðû metasceiðn kaiú
ajnaqhðnai ojlivgon, oåpwû thún oJdoún hJmwðn ajkovpwû ajnuvswmen.»
1Aresqeiúû ouøn thðé touð tovpou terpnovthti, kaiú deleasqeiúû thðé
touð sunodoipovrou trisshðé sumboulivaé, ajnapeswún kaiú sunestiasqeiúû
