aJgivou patroúû kellivon, kaiú dhú mhnuqeiúû ejdevxon uJpoú touð
sebasmivou ajndroúû Benedivktou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0159" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0159D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð aJgivou patroúû sebasmivou.</FOREIGN></NOTE> .  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Peswún ouøn ejpiú thún ghðn,
