paravptwma oåper kataú thún oJdoún aujtwðé sunevbhken</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0159" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0159D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paraú thún oJdoún sunevbh.</FOREIGN></NOTE> ,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wjneivdise,
levgwn× «Tiv ejstin, ajdelfeú, oåper oJ ejcqrovû soi diaú touð
sunodoipovrou kateirgavsato_ toú prwðton planhðsaiv se oujk
