carisqhðnaiú moi taúû yucaúû twðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0167" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0167D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>twðn ejn Cristwðé ajdelfwðn mou twðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn kurivwé mou ajdelfwðn
 <COL N="0167C"></COL> twðn ejn twðé monasthrivwé oijkouvntwn.» Benevdiktoû meún ejkeiðnoû
