par1 aujtouð dexavmenoû taú ejnevcura, ajnecwvrhsen ejk thðû
monhðû qaumavzwn× hJmeiðû deú oJrwðmen ajrtivwû uJpoú touð gevnouû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="4" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0167" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0167D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eæqnouû twðn Log.</FOREIGN>  Quam diversam lectionem non
annotaremus, nisi alia mendose in ed. Guss. irrepsisset,
scilicet  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eæqouû.</FOREIGN></NOTE> 
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>twðn Loggobavrdwn kataluqeún toú monasthvrion aujtouð× ajnapauomevnwn
gaúr twðn ajdelfwðn mesonuktivwé, aæfnw eijsphdhvsanteû
ejn twðé monasthrivwé oiJ Loggobavrdoi, pavnta taú ejn thðé monhðé diarpavsanteû, ouj sunecwrhvqhsan pantelwðû tinoû
twðn ajdelfwðn ejpikrateiðû genevsqai× hJ gaúr touð ajnqrwvpou touð Qeouð proseuchú ejfrouvrei touvtouû, proúû toú paðsi
