Benedivktou dihghqevnta moi oujdamwðû hJgouðmai divkaion
sighðé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="2" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0183" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0183D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>divkaion sighðsai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paradouðnai. Eiærhke gavr moi oJ aujtoúû, oåti eæn tini
