oujc euJrivskomen touðton distavsanta. Aujthún gaúr thún eujdivan hæqele diameiðnai, hånper sunevbh eiønai, oåte ajpoú thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="3" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0195" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0195D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>monhðû eijshðlqen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>monhðû
